## Third-party material in the pr skill

`.agents/skills/pr/SKILL.md` reproduces prose from the `show-me` skill in
[humanlayer/skills](https://github.com/humanlayer/skills/blob/main/plugins/show-me/skills/show-me/SKILL.md),
by Dex Horthy. The Summary section's menu of visuals (pseudocode, call trees, component trees, file
trees, Mermaid, diffs) and its placement guidance come from that skill, reproduced almost word for
word and aimed at a diff instead of a live conversation.

That material is MIT licensed — `Copyright (c) 2026 HumanLayer` — and is covered by the licence copy
above. The specific change is disclosed in [`.agents/skills/pr/CREDITS.md`](.agents/skills/pr/CREDITS.md);
the skill's own metadata records this path, while the link text in that file names a different
repository.
